{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smartphones-2509-0317","content_id":"a21a696c-b334-4038-b670-065e710bfa6b","description":"Product Safety Report for Google Pixel 6a Smartphones presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"1c29069e-be38-498f-ac6e-ca42e8b2e3d1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-13T17:53:54+00:00","id":"1c29069e-be38-498f-ac6e-ca42e8b2e3d1","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-13T17:53:54+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69161b329d50fc2fe81617c0/2509-0317-product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smart-phone.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Google Pixel 6a Smartphone</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as the batteries may overheat during normal use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: Google initiated a remote firmware update in July 2025.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Communication and Media Equipment - Mobile Phones/Smartphones</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Google</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Pixel 6a</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturing and Sales Period</td>\n      <td>The Pixel 6a was manufactured between January 2022 and August 2023 and sold until March 2024, but other distributors may have sold products beyond this date.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Vietnam</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Smartphone running on the Android operating system with a rechargeable lithium-ion battery.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_1c29069e-be38-498f-ac6e-ca42e8b2e3d1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69161b329d50fc2fe81617c0/2509-0317-product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smart-phone.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been identified as presenting a risk of fire as the batteries may overheat during normal use.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>This corrective action has been ongoing since July 2025.</p>\n\n<p>Google initiated a remote firmware update in July 2025. Consumers with impacted units received email and on-device notifications of the firmware update, which was rolled out remotely and automatically to impacted devices. The update reduced the risk of the battery overheating by reducing its battery capacity and charging speed. </p>\n\n<p>Consumers with impacted products may be eligible for a free repair, cash payment or Google Store hardware discount credit, depending on location. Access the Google website for further information, and to access the Registration Page, at the following link: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"http://g.co/pixel/6abattery\">g.co/pixel/6abattery</a></p>\n\n<p>You do not need to contact Google if:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>You have already received an appeasement</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Google has already confirmed you do not have an impacted product</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2509-0317</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-14T10:01:24Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"communication-media-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-07-20","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-14T10:01:24+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smartphones-2509-0317","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smartphones-2509-0317","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smartphones-2509-0317","content_id":"a21a696c-b334-4038-b670-065e710bfa6b","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-14T10:01:24Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Google Pixel 6a Smartphones (2509-0317)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-google-pixel-6a-smartphones-2509-0317","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert 